-- 2028, so Monday 19 June 2028; for 13 months: beyond r 5.12(2).
#ASSERT `Until when can my writ be served` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2027) 6 FALSE EQUALS JUST (`d` 1 12 2027)
#ASSERT `Until when can my writ be served` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2027) 12 FALSE EQUALS JUST (`d` 19 6 2028)
#ASSERT `Until when can my writ be served` (`d` 1 6 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 6 2027) 13 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

